ina","r":[0.1278,0.6748,0.0389,0.0311]},{"n":"Escoffier","r":[0.1741,0.6748,0.0389,0.0311]},{"n":"Shenhe","r":[0.2204,0.6748,0.0389,0.0311]}]}]}},"thumb":"content/genshin/builds/freminet/261111-224925/en-1.t.webp","why":{"w":[{"name":"A Thousand Blazing Suns","text":"High CRIT and ATK strengthen Skill hits."},{"name":"Fang of the Mountain King","text":"Strong stats and Skill damage scaling."},{"name":"Song of Broken Pines","text":"Physical DMG and ATK SPD for his hits. Physical build."},{"name":"Skyward Pride","text":"ER helps Burst uptime; Physical blades. High ER needs."},{"name":"Serpent Spine","text":"CRIT Rate and stacking damage bonus. Avoid taking damage."},{"name":"Tidal Shadow","text":"Large ATK bonus after receiving healing. Needs healing."},{"name":"Snow-Tombed Starsilver","text":"Physical DMG secondary stat; accessible. Physical build."},{"name":"Prototype Archaic","text":"Simple ATK-focused free craft option."}],"a":[{"names":["Pale Flame"],"text":"Physical DMG and ATK from Skill.","stats":"ATK% · Physical · CRIT"},{"names":["Marechaussee Hunter"],"text":"CRIT Rate with Furina HP changes.","stats":"ATK% · Physical · CRIT"},{"names":["Pale Flame","Bloodstained Chivalry"],"text":"Always-on Physical DMG bonus.","stats":"ATK% · Physical · CRIT"}],"t":[{"name":"Frostbite Circuit","members":["Freminet","Furina","Fischl","Mika"],"text":"Furina enables Shatter and buffs damage; Fischl applies Superconduct; Mika heals and boosts Physical damage.","roles":["On-field DPS","Off-field DPS / Buffer","Off-field DPS / Battery","Healer / Physical Buffer"]},{"name":"Deep-Sea Shatter","members":["Freminet","Xingqiu","Fischl","Diona"],"text":"Xingqiu enables Freeze and Shatter, Fischl enables Superconduct, and Diona supplies Cryo particles and sustain.","roles":["On-field DPS","Off-field DPS / Hydro Enabler","Off-field DPS / Battery","Shielder / Healer"]},{"name":"Clockwork Hyperbloom","members":["Freminet","Nahida","Xingqiu","Kuki Shinobu"],"text":"Freminet drives Xingqiu while Nahida produces cores; Kuki triggers Hyperbloom. Use Level 4 Physical strikes.","roles":["On-field DPS","Dendro Enabler / Buffer","Off-field DPS / Hydro Enabler","Healer / Reaction Trigger"]},{"name":"Cryo Pressure","members":["Freminet","Furina","Escoffier","Shenhe"],"text":"Furina enables Freeze and buffs damage; Escoffier heals and shreds resistance; Shenhe amplifies Cryo Skill strikes.","roles":["On-field DPS","Off-field DPS / Buffer","Healer / Debuffer","Cryo Buffer"]}],"v":"Cryo Skill: Use Cryo goblet and Blizzard Strayer; spam Level 0 Skill strikes during Burst.\nFurina Team: Marechaussee Hunter adds CRIT Rate with HP fluctuations; bring a healer.\nHyperbloom: Stay Physical and drive Hydro attacks; the Electro teammate owns Hyperbloom.\nF2P Physical: Craft Tidal Shadow with healing, or Snow-Tombed Starsilver; use Pale Flame.\nPlunge DPS: With Xianyun use Long Night’s Oath and prioritize Normal Attack talent.","n":4},"seo":{"roles":["Main DPS / Physical"],"about":"Freminet is an on-field Cryo claymore DPS who uses Pers Timer to deliver powerful Physical or Cryo Skill strikes. Physical builds reach Pressure Level 4, while Cryo builds repeatedly use Level 0. Hydro enables Shatter; Electro enables Superconduct.","pros":["Flexible Physical/Cryo","Strong Skill damage","Shatter synergy","F2P weapon choices"],"cons":["Needs field time","High ER before C2","Shatter needs Hydro","Combo timing matters"],"weapons":["A Thousand Blazing Suns","Fang of the Mountain King","Song of Broken Pines","Skyward Pride","Serpent Spine","Tidal Shadow","Snow-Tombed Starsilver","Prototype Archaic"],"arts":[{"sets":["Pale Flame"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":""},{"sets":["Marechaussee Hunter"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":""},{"sets":["Pale Flame","Bloodstained Chivalry"],"pcs":"2 + 2 pcs","role":""}],"main":["ATK% / Energy Recharge","Physical DMG Bonus","Crit Rate / Crit DMG"],"stats":["ER C0: 130-180%","ER C2+: 110-150%","CRIT Rate: 60-75%","CRIT DMG: 120%+","ATK: 1,600+"],"vars":[{"title":"Cryo